20","zh":"馬許尋求砂紙和平協議，呼籲康明斯、保齡球手和 CA 分擔責任"},{"title":"Report: Philadelphia Phillies Make Brandon Marsh Contract Decision","src":"Heavy.com","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxQNG5Rb2hwMXNDYVMzblVONTFYR21QWjJkZlVaM3IzSl90TkQ1RW0wM3o5OGY0QzYwZ2Jhc1FLUVF4d0kzb1dUaHVnWFBvWmdER3RyUDQxaVkycklMOEdNemFfdS1MTUFucXR6YUllYlN2ZUI3Zld1WFpnZ1FYLWlLTThMR2daREdLcDhZMS0tY2U5V1hxZTlnV3lFa29tWjNQTTJYX1VrakhEVVhrSzRQRGN3?oc=5","date":"2026-11-20","zh":"報告：費城費城人做出布蘭登馬什合約決定"}],"themes":[{"name":"訂單/合約","count":6},{"name":"AI 人工智慧","count":1},{"name":"能源/電力","count":1},{"name":"併購","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-09","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/62709/000006270926000022/mrsh-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"References in this report to \"we\", \"us\" and \"our\" are to Marsh & McLennan Companies, Inc. and its consolidated subsidiaries (the \"Company\" or \"Marsh\"), unless the context otherwise requires. Effective January 14, 2026, we updated our brand name from Marsh McLennan to Marsh and the brand names of our Marsh and Oliver Wyman Group businesses to Marsh Risk and Marsh Management Consulting, respectively. References to the Company and its businesses in this report reflect these changes. Mercer and Guy Carpenter will continue to report under their current brands through a transition period.","zh":"除非上下文另有要求，本報告中提及的「我們」和「我們的」均指 Marsh & McLennan Companies, Inc. 及其合併子公司（「本公司」或「Marsh」）。自 2026 年 1 月 14 日起，我們將品牌名稱從 Marsh McLennan 更新為 Marsh，並將 Marsh 和 Oliver Wyman Group 業務的品牌名稱分別更新為 Marsh Risk 和 Marsh Management Consulting。本報告中提及的公司及其業務反映了這些變化。美世和蓋伊·卡彭特將在過渡期內繼續以其現有品牌進行報告。"},{"en":"Marsh is a global leader in risk, reinsurance and capital, people and investments, and management consulting, advising clients in 130 countries. With an annual revenue of $27 billion and more than 95,000 colleagues, Marsh helps build the confidence to thrive through the power of perspective.","zh":"達信是風險、再保險和資本、人員和投資以及管理諮詢領域的全球領導者，為 130 個國家的客戶提供諮詢服務。達信年收入達 270 億美元，擁有超過 95,000 名同事，透過遠見卓識幫助人們建立信心，實現蓬勃發展。"},{"en":"Consulting: health, wealth and career advice, solutions and products, and specialized management, strategic, economic and brand consulting services conducted through Mercer and Marsh Management Consulting.","zh":"諮詢：健康、財富和職業建議、解決方案和產品，以及透過美世和達信管理諮詢提供的專業管理、策略、經濟和品牌諮詢服務。"}],"markets":[{"en":"This segment accounted for approximately 64% of the Company's total revenue in 2025 and employed around 55,700 colleagues globally. It includes Marsh Risk and Guy Carpenter.","zh":"該部門約占公司 2025 年總收入的 64%，在全球擁有約 55,700 名員工。其中包括 Marsh Risk 和 Guy Carpenter。"},{"en":"Marsh Risk is the world's leading insurance broker and risk advisor, offering risk management, insurance broking, insurance program management, risk consulting, analytical modeling and alternative risk financing services to a wide range of businesses, government entities, professional service organizations and individuals in 130 countries. It employs approximately 52,000 colleagues and generated approximately 54% of the Company's total revenue in 2025.","zh":"Marsh Risk 是全球領先的保險經紀人和風險顧問，為 130 個國家的眾多企業、政府實體、專業服務組織和個人提供風險管理、保險經紀、保險計劃管理、風險諮詢、分析建模和另類風險融資服務。該公司擁有約 52,000 名員工，2025 年的收入約占公司總收入的 54%。"}],"customers":[],"competition":[{"en":"The Company faces intense competition across all its businesses, from providers of similar services to competition from third parties in identifying acquisition targets. Competition is based on service sophistication, range, quality, and cost. Attracting and retaining qualified colleagues is also highly competitive and competition for talent continues to intensify. The landscape varies across geographies, industries, and market segments, as detailed in \"Risks Relating to the Company Generally — Competitive Risks\" in Part I, Item 1A.","zh":"該公司的所有業務都面臨激烈的競爭，從類似服務的提供者到來自第三方在確定收購目標方面的競爭。競爭基於服務的複雜程度、範圍、品質和成本。吸引和留住合格的同事也面臨激烈的競爭，人才競爭不斷加劇。不同地區、產業和細分市場的情況各不相同，詳見第一部分第 1A 項「與公司相關的一般風險 - 競爭風險」。"},{"en":"In insurance and reinsurance, the Company encounters strong competition from other insurance and reinsurance brokerage firms operating on a global, regional, national or local scale, from independent insurance and reinsurance companies that market, distribute and service their products without the assistance of brokers and from other businesses, including commercial and investment banks, consultants, and online platforms, to traditional insurance brokerage services. The entry of third-party capital providers and clients opting for self-insurance or direct coverage further intensifies competition. Certain insureds and groups of insureds have established programs of self-insurance as a supplement or alternative to purchasing traditional third-party insurance placements. Certain insureds also obtain coverage directly from insurance providers. Managing general agents, affinity programs, and ","zh":"在保險和再保險領域，公司面臨著來自在全球、區域、國家或地方範圍內運營的其他保險和再保險經紀公司的激烈競爭，從在沒有經紀人協助的情況下營銷、分銷和服務其產品的獨立保險和再保險公司，以及來自包括商業和投資銀行、顧問和在線平台在內的其他企業到傳統保險經紀服務的激烈競爭。第三方資本提供者和選擇自保或直接承保的客戶的進入進一步加劇了競爭。某些被保險人和被保險人群體已經制定了自我保險計劃，作為購買傳統第三方保險安排的補充或替代方案。某些被保險人也直接向保險公司獲得保險。管理總代理、親和計劃以及"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Riskand Insurance Services","val":17265000000,"zh":"風險與保險服務部門"},{"name":"Consulting","val":9794000000,"zh":"諮詢部門"}],"total":26981000000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":13344000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Other Geographic Areas","val":9899000000,"zh":"其他地理區域"},{"name":"GB","val":3816000000,"zh":"英國"}],"total":26981000000}},"peers":["AON","AJG","PGR","CB","NTRS"]}}